  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Flunitrazepam is a benzodiazepine sedative used as a hypnotic for insomnia and as an anxiolytic. It remains an approved medicine in some countries but is tightly controlled, and its misuse as an illicit drug has led to restrictions or withdrawal in many places.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q62947&quot;>Wikidata Q62947</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>flunitrazepam</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N05CD03</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB01544&quot;>DB01544</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/3380&quot;>3380</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:31622&quot;>31622</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q62947&quot;>Q62947</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C16H12FN3O3</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>313.288 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
